 Movie","year":"2019","type":"Фильм","rating":5.7,"votes":15,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wHM4hOpIbrE7U6a0zLhtUgYJSI.jpg","genres":["комедия","мелодрама"],"overview":"Владелица косметической компании пойдет на всё, чтобы спасти свою загибающуюся империю. Она во что бы то ни стало хочет завладеть волшебной водой из парилки, но для этого ей придется побороться с Парнями из Парилки, которые будут всеми путями противостоять ее злым козням.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"387848","ru":"친구엄마","en":"친구엄마","year":"2015","type":"Фильм","rating":5.7,"votes":15,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5JDVEZN0v3e9xMzZbZ92fC7HaQi.jpg","genres":["драма","мелодрама"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"673718","ru":"予兆 散歩する侵略者 劇場版","en":"予兆 散歩する侵略者 劇場版","year":"2017","type":"Фильм","rating":5.7,"votes":15,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/p1H94Avu1Gf22pqfDdeffm2oge7.jpg","genres":["фантастика"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"497622","ru":"Change in the Air","en":"Change in the Air","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":5.7,"votes":15,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uftXF12Z7PfrS32muM3eDZXJF70.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"521920","ru":"のみとり侍","en":"のみとり侍","year":"2018","type":"Фильм","rating":5.7,"votes":15,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/npeCu2uslYuSFQJKV793bYpnCCQ.jpg","genres":["комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"447233","ru":"Wonderkid","en":"Wonderkid","year":"2016","type":"Фильм","rating":5.7,"votes":15,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/a8BBOzVUGA0s2Yk2scxd0KRNS8R.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overvie